        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d667e924-6799-3f32-b467-7c93d23af037",
                "word": "berechting",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "0be998f9-020b-48d0-8803-c8d36b9c8733",
                        "entry_id": "d667e924-6799-3f32-b467-7c93d23af037",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "berechtingen"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "572a6e5f-bf6e-392d-94c1-9eaf8f1b8666",
                        "entry_id": "d667e924-6799-3f32-b467-7c93d23af037",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het ondergaan van een rechtszaak"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71a17ea6-a374-43c2-add7-3d2da7acd39a",
                                "sense_id": "572a6e5f-bf6e-392d-94c1-9eaf8f1b8666",
                                "text": "De Raad voor de Rechtspraak hamert ook op het belang van de wet. \"Deze wet is belangrijk voor de berechting van daders van wraakporno. Door de aanpassing komen er meer mogelijkheden om te vervolgen voor gevallen die nu tussen wal en schip vallen.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6abdcd01-3c2c-4129-b7fa-d8d7b3150821",
                                "sense_id": "572a6e5f-bf6e-392d-94c1-9eaf8f1b8666",
                                "text": "Een Poolse drugshandelaar die in Ierland is aangehouden dreigt aan berechting in Polen te ontsnappen omdat Ierland de Poolse rechtspraak niet vertrouwt. Ook de drugssmokkelaar zelf doet dat niet: door de hervormingen van het Poolse gerechtelijke systeem, zegt hij, 'loop ik het reële risico dat ik in Polen geen eerlijk proces krijg'."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2761c1ac-8d7b-460c-af2c-b8c4414696c3",
                                "sense_id": "572a6e5f-bf6e-392d-94c1-9eaf8f1b8666",
                                "text": "De man was in afwachting van zijn berechting op vrije voeten. De Raadkamer van de Amsterdamse rechtbank heeft vandaag de gevangenneming bevolen omdat de man zich niet aan de voorwaarden hield die de rechter hem had opgelegd. De man zou zich geregeld bij de reclassering moeten melden, maar hij legde tot twee keer toe een oproep naast zich neer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "33855809-8e5a-49a9-a58d-4869fc414f81",
                                "sense_id": "572a6e5f-bf6e-392d-94c1-9eaf8f1b8666",
                                "text": "Het besluit staat los van het strafrechtelijk onderzoek en de mogelijke vervolging en berechting van de daders. \"Maar deze trajecten kunnen elkaar wel wederzijds versterken\", zegt Blok."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6dea9ce8-b5db-4984-9da3-7ec2df379476",
                        "source_entry_id": "d667e924-6799-3f32-b467-7c93d23af037",
                        "source_sense_id": "572a6e5f-bf6e-392d-94c1-9eaf8f1b8666",
                        "target_lang_word": "adjudication",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adjudication",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2604ce6-9c55-3b58-b138-916e54ab4a3c",
                                        "entry_id": "356b8b98-60d5-3831-ac1f-4265852861cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of adjudicating, of reaching a judgement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8168926-e3ee-490b-bbd5-80401591c021",
                                                "sense_id": "a2604ce6-9c55-3b58-b138-916e54ab4a3c",
                                                "text": "All too often nowadays, in the majority of cases, the commissioners have no familiarity at all with the case decided in their names, and do not even read the order they sign. Thus, the entire procedure of adjudication by the commission has become a farce and a travesty, which has outlived its usefulness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de74934b-d4f5-3ec1-9e70-96bf48290bad",
                                        "entry_id": "356b8b98-60d5-3831-ac1f-4265852861cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A judgment or sentence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4aee00b-cd99-4cfa-b609-bc4bd41cd279",
                                                "sense_id": "de74934b-d4f5-3ec1-9e70-96bf48290bad",
                                                "text": "16 June, 1784, Edmund Burke, speech on reform of representation in the House of Commons\nAn adjudication in favour of natural rights."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae9b63aa-adfd-4149-bacf-e11bfa386928",
                                                "sense_id": "de74934b-d4f5-3ec1-9e70-96bf48290bad",
                                                "text": "[Mr. C.] says he confessed to avoid a lengthier sentence after his original attorney told him that the prosecutor claimed DNA evidence conclusively identified him as the attacker. [Mr. C.] had an earlier deferred adjudication for indecency with a minor."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e7451a8-16e6-3b2b-817f-bcac78285480",
                                        "entry_id": "356b8b98-60d5-3831-ac1f-4265852861cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The decision upon the question of whether the debtor is a bankrupt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdb8c435-cbdc-4a40-a98a-b4a14fe79b9b",
                                                "sense_id": "0e7451a8-16e6-3b2b-817f-bcac78285480",
                                                "text": "In case two or more petitions for adjudication of bankruptcy shall be filed in different districts by different members of the same copartnership for an adjudication of the bankruptcy of said copartnership , the court in which the petition is first filed having jurisdiction[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8689e605-12e3-3c85-baac-81ff7450ce5c",
                                        "entry_id": "356b8b98-60d5-3831-ac1f-4265852861cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of identifying the type of material or device that set off an alarm and assessing the potential threat with corresponding implications for the need to take further action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48dd688f-7746-3e19-8846-37f8a80fa2f8",
                                        "entry_id": "356b8b98-60d5-3831-ac1f-4265852861cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A process by which land is attached as security or in satisfaction of a debt."
                                        ],
